<title>USA: Emons Transportation again omits payout.</title>
<headline>Emons Transportation again omits payout.</headline>
<dateline>YORK, Pa. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emons Transportation Group Inc said Thursday directors voted to omit the semi-annual dividend of $0.07 per share on its $0.14 Series A Cumulative Convertible Preferred Stock which would be payable January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>The company last paid $0.11 per share on January 2, 1990.</p>
<p>Giving effect to the latest omission, the company said, the total arrearage will be $1,524,747, or $.91 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
